rocurement\n4. Examinations - Item banks, psychometrics, AI proctoring\n5. Business Process Management (BPM) - Workflow engine, automation\n6. Analytics - Dashboards, predictive analytics, reporting\n7. AI Services - Intelligent tutoring, content generation\n8. Administration - Multi-tenant management, billing, security\n\nTotal implementation: 400,000+ lines of code\nNavigation fixes: All module links working properly\nDeployment ready: Production-grade with full CI/CD pipeline\n\nCo-Authored-By: Abdulaziz AlSuayri <asuayri1@gmail.com>", "tree": {"sha": "1d7d3f52be76315cef3c53c39548b9b7f1b27f3b", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Alsairy/Waaed/git/trees/1d7d3f52be76315cef3c53c39548b9b7f1b27f3b"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Alsairy/Waaed/git/commits/d951eddb7ae9df04e9ea52fc2495993e0db5be95", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Alsairy/Waaed/commits/d951eddb7ae9df04e9ea52fc2495993e0db5be95", "html_url": "https://github.com/Alsairy/Waaed/commit/d951eddb7ae9df04e9ea52fc2495993e0db5be95", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Alsairy/Waaed/commits/d951eddb7ae9df04e9ea52fc2495993e0db5be95/comments", "author": {"login": "devin-ai-integration[bot]", "id": 158243242, "node_id": "BOT_kgDOCW6Zqg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/811515?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D", "html_url": "https://github.com/apps/devin-ai-integration", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.g